Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.26,0:00:58.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笑什么，真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.29,0:01:00.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位，抱歉我迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.46,0:01:08.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭，你怎么这身打扮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.68,0:01:11.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈说既然来就要像模像样地来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.47,0:01:13.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是来野营而已
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.39,0:01:15.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你妈妈是怎么想的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.45,0:01:18.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过你这书包好大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.14,0:01:20.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面都放了些什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:24.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈塞了好多东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.02,0:01:32.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,语文，数学，物理，社科的参考书，睡眠学习机
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.28,0:01:38.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有蚊香，防止腹部着凉的腰带，枕头
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.87,0:01:42.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有闹钟，这是咖喱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.34,0:01:45.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有很多罐头
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.27,0:01:52.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有这个，那个，这些这些
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.13,0:03:02.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,着火了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.31,0:03:22.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快往上风口跑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.94,0:03:25.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上风口是哪哪哪…哪边？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.63,0:03:30.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭，用气把火焰吹散，你行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.31,0:03:31.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.25,0:03:33.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:36.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁现在快出来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.61,0:05:02.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚才还以为死定了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.33,0:05:04.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.12,0:05:08.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动物们就头疼了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.53,0:05:17.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.07,0:05:19.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.07,0:05:26.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布尔玛小姐，龙珠雷达能借我用用吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.62,0:05:28.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龙珠雷达？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.94,0:05:33.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:38.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都是好孩子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.41,0:05:41.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小林叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.24,0:05:59.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 光一闪 穿越片片云彩 想Fly Away （就Fly Away） ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.62,0:06:06.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 全景壮阔无垠 身心融入 豁然展开 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.83,0:06:12.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 脚一落 就给了地球脸上一踹 来火吗 （请尽管来） ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.16,0:06:17.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 给个火山爆发 也毫无大碍 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.93,0:06:25.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 要是让北极万年冰也融化 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.52,0:06:34.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 若有恐龙活过来 我正好能带它上马戏台 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.44,0:06:38.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ CHA-LA HEAD-CHA-LA ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.12,0:06:46.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 凡事都能够以不变应万变 天塌下来当被盖 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.87,0:06:50.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ CHA-LA HEAD-CHA-LA ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.59,0:06:56.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 但内心的澎湃 谁也不明白 就像骚动的元气弹… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.26,0:06:59.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ CHA-LA HEAD-CHA-LA ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.85,0:07:07.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 脑袋空空荡荡倒也不坏 正好梦想能满载 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.73,0:07:12.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ CHA-LA HEAD-CHA-LA ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.36,0:07:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 让笑颜也突破究极的界限 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.90,0:07:19.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 今天明天每一天都… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.11,0:07:21.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ Sparking ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.74,0:07:40.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《地球争霸超决战》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.31,0:08:10.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快速龙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.12,0:08:12.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快回来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.51,0:08:26.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样，神龙会把大家的森林复原的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.15,0:08:27.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.90,0:08:34.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟神龙这张脸也挺吓人的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.60,0:08:37.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难怪快速龙会害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.89,0:08:42.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，说出你们的愿望来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.28,0:08:46.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何愿望我都可以实现，仅限一个
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.64,0:08:50.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请把这片森林恢复原样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.62,0:08:53.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太容易了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.88,0:09:30.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的愿望实现了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.82,0:09:35.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.37,0:10:09.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.22,0:11:21.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达列斯大人，地球上有生命反应
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.42,0:11:27.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能，卡卡罗特应该是被送到地球去的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.02,0:11:29.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且是很早以前
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.39,0:11:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想不到这么美
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.94,0:11:40.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达列斯大人，向您祝贺
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.49,0:11:44.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球的土壤好像十分适合种植神精树
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.80,0:11:53.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空，水温怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.06,0:11:56.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点温，琪琪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.30,0:11:58.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸，我们来比赛吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.11,0:11:59.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.60,0:12:22.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.37,0:12:30.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我输了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.52,0:12:35.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快速龙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.80,0:12:36.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.00,0:12:39.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我最近提到的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.29,0:12:42.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亏你找得到我家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:48.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很可爱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.74,0:12:49.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里可爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.20,0:12:51.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.12,0:12:55.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这孩子真的越变越坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.34,0:12:58.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从和悟空的朋友玩在一起之后
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.91,0:13:00.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就一点都不学习了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.10,0:13:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琪琪，差不多可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.26,0:13:05.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空你给我闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.45,0:13:09.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是这样的话，我就不能再让你玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.36,0:13:12.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会好好学习的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.70,0:13:14.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这才是我的好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.34,0:13:18.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我可以养快速龙了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.50,0:13:19.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让它回山里去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.07,0:13:23.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不擅长应付这类东西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.46,0:13:25.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.54,0:13:28.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了吗，现在马上让它回去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.65,0:13:36.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起，你回山里去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.28,0:13:38.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会去找你玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.12,0:13:43.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了，拜拜啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.64,0:13:45.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.54,0:13:55.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.97,0:13:57.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.40,0:14:17.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里怎么样，悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.82,0:14:20.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你，爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.99,0:14:25.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过不能告诉妈妈哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.51,0:14:40.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,普洱，这车坐着感觉怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.30,0:14:42.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.20,0:14:43.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧，对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.52,0:14:45.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟买这个要还15年贷款呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.75,0:14:48.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,银行还真信得过你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.34,0:14:54.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好歹我也在天下第一武道会上一战成名了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.33,0:14:57.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开这个去，大伙肯定会吓一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.84,0:14:58.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.57,0:15:03.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,饮茶少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.15,0:15:05.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这股气是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.73,0:15:11.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从刚才开始就感觉到不祥之气
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.08,0:15:58.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牢牢扎根吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.09,0:16:06.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早日结果哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.06,0:16:23.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.78,0:16:46.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭，吃饭了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:48.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.34,0:16:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待会儿再玩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.51,0:16:53.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.85,0:17:54.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想不到地球这么适合种植神精树
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.73,0:18:01.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也多亏了卡卡罗特没对这颗星球造成丝毫破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.20,0:19:21.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.89,0:20:03.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可真是倒了大霉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.16,0:20:07.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,15年的贷款都灰飞烟灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.89,0:20:10.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.06,0:20:13.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然拜访真不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.18,0:20:16.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么会买那么贵的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.58,0:20:18.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又想去讨女孩子欢心了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.99,0:20:20.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不，不，不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.68,0:20:24.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的，不顾一切就直接买了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.62,0:20:31.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琪琪，给你添麻烦了，真不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.97,0:20:33.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.64,0:20:36.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要不影响悟饭学习
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.13,0:20:38.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您想待多久就待多久
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.79,0:20:41.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学习的话，我可以教他，怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.63,0:20:45.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那才是我最担心的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.90,0:20:57.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快速龙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.61,0:21:02.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭，你还没让它回去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.90,0:21:04.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.51,0:21:10.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，没什么关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.12,0:21:14.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空，你又和悟饭串通一气
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.80,0:21:16.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有的事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.49,0:21:20.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得待在洞里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.80,0:21:26.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.50,0:21:27.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.80,0:21:29.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,客人还在
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.29,0:21:30.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快让它回去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.86,0:21:31.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.09,0:21:34.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉，你在洞里等我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.59,0:21:39.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行，现在不能陪你玩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.65,0:21:43.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.11,0:21:52.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉样子有点怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.78,0:21:54.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它只是想玩而已
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.28,0:21:55.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.18,0:21:58.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,界王大人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.59,0:22:01.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空啊，出大事了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.13,0:22:03.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出大事？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.49,0:22:08.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一棵叫神精树的恶树在地球扎根了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.05,0:22:10.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神精树？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.85,0:22:15.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它的果实本来只有神仙才可以吃
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.43,0:22:18.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神精树一旦扎根
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.44,0:22:22.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会把大地的营养全部吸收殆尽，然后结果
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.05,0:22:25.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,令周围的植物枯萎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.81,0:22:28.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后让整个星球都变成沙漠
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.96,0:22:34.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其后的数百年间连一根杂草都长不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.49,0:22:35.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.60,0:22:41.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说，一旦扎根就晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.20,0:22:44.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它的果实会把地球的营养全部吸收掉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.79,0:22:48.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后把地球变成沙漠
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.77,0:22:54.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么我们的地球
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.22,0:22:59.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很遗憾，已经晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.36,0:23:02.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不相信呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.85,0:23:10.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果实马上就成熟了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.83,0:23:14.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要吃了这吸取了地球能量的果实
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.44,0:23:17.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就又能提升力量了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.68,0:23:22.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙第一的破坏者·达列斯军团是所向无敌的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.17,0:23:26.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是那个弗利萨也不是我们的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.52,0:23:30.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达列斯大人才是大宇宙的帝王
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.22,0:23:36.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这全靠了神精树的果实
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.42,0:23:37.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.37,0:23:43.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是多亏了卡卡罗特那个蠢货
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.71,0:23:50.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,树木全都会枯萎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.32,0:23:52.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水也会枯竭吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.68,0:23:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.32,0:24:00.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过，一旦它扎根了就晚了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.15,0:24:04.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我们的力量联合起来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.63,0:24:07.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该能把它连根铲除
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.52,0:24:08.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.02,0:24:10.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干吧，各位
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.04,0:24:11.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.63,0:24:14.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.58,0:24:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭，你不能去
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.34,0:24:24.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.79,0:24:37.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易请神龙把这森林恢复原样的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.36,0:24:40.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这到底是谁干的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.65,0:24:42.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好，动手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.96,0:25:16.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空，再来一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.94,0:25:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没用的，除非把地球炸个粉碎
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.89,0:25:21.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然这树根是不会消失的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.24,0:25:49.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人能破坏得了这颗神精树
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.74,0:25:51.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉到他们的气非同小可
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.50,0:25:54.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些家伙什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.69,0:25:59.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,种下这树的人是你们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.53,0:26:04.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妨碍我们的人只有死路一条
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.38,0:26:07.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那爆炸也是你们干的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.33,0:26:11.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还我的新车，你们这帮混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.99,0:26:16.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些人虽然看着不像是赛亚人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.98,0:26:19.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但总有一种不祥的预感
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.50,0:26:25.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他该不会是讨厌我了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.98,0:26:35.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是太生气了，跑回森林里去了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.40,0:26:42.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快速龙
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.54,0:27:00.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我的贷款还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.23,0:27:14.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,饺子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.20,0:27:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷兹恩
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.98,0:27:27.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉卡塞
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.07,0:27:31.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们俩是双胞胎兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.20,0:27:33.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太阳拳
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.11,0:27:48.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气圆斩
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.18,0:28:01.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接招
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.79,0:28:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想赢我就得这么干
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.11,0:28:24.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.12,0:28:30.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缲气弹
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.31,0:28:59.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,饮茶
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.25,0:29:05.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的对手是我
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.60,0:29:19.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然敢耍小聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.70,0:29:29.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.68,0:29:32.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不许破坏动物们的森林
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.80,0:29:36.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不走运，又碰到一个小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.24,0:29:41.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.70,0:29:43.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.46,0:29:45.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个小鬼是
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.23,0:29:50.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赛亚人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.23,0:29:54.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次我可不会手下留情了，受死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.45,0:29:59.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔闪光
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.30,0:30:12.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.90,0:30:15.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那小鬼呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.26,0:30:17.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.45,0:30:18.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.36,0:30:24.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.33,0:30:29.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这小子是货真价实的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.06,0:30:38.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪，快速龙跑哪儿去了呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.21,0:30:41.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是藏起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.29,0:30:44.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望它没事
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.27,0:30:51.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.78,0:30:56.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了，你是卡卡罗特的儿子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.34,0:30:59.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是我爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.44,0:31:07.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和卡卡罗特长得很像也并不奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.42,0:31:12.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟我们这些用完就扔的下级战士类型太少了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.11,0:31:18.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战斗力一万
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.64,0:31:22.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是赛亚人的后代
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.80,0:31:25.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.93,0:31:26.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.66,0:31:28.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.08,0:31:31.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赛亚人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.69,0:31:34.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对，我的名字是达列斯
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.11,0:31:36.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达列斯
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.46,0:31:38.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样，小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.02,0:31:40.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想跟我一起组队吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.64,0:31:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以尽情遨游宇宙，破坏你喜欢的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.70,0:31:48.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整天吃喝玩乐
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.79,0:31:51.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种快乐的日子可遇不可求喔
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.30,0:31:57.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁要跟你这种人组队
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.11,0:32:04.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，喂，别那么无情嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.95,0:32:08.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是幸存下来为数不多的赛亚人同胞
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.57,0:32:11.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要好好相处啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.97,0:32:19.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个美丽的蔚蓝星球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.12,0:32:23.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终将会枯萎成红褐色
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.26,0:32:26.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是跟我走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.17,0:32:30.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是说，你现在就想死呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.32,0:32:35.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人来了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.84,0:32:37.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战斗力18000
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.38,0:32:38.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.52,0:32:50.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这家伙是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.11,0:32:53.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,短笛叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.83,0:32:56.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.17,0:32:58.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我郑重拒绝
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.22,0:33:00.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.10,0:33:07.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,短笛叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.08,0:33:07.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.94,0:33:09.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯，还好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.34,0:33:30.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赛亚人就该有赛亚人的生存方式
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.08,0:33:36.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则，你那漂亮的尾巴会哭的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.33,0:33:47.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我来告诉你它正确的使用方法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.74,0:33:49.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个最能够意识到
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.20,0:33:52.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是赛亚人的使用方法
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.68,0:34:06.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道这是什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.75,0:34:08.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小月亮喔
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.97,0:34:14.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混合氧气，绽放光芒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.97,0:34:36.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小鬼，让我见识一下你赛亚人的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.55,0:34:46.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要看，悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.49,0:35:11.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不消灭它，连我都会变成巨猿的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.35,0:35:15.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我制造的能量光球的效果还能持续一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.96,0:35:20.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，让我看看你的本来面目吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.95,0:35:26.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你竟敢对我的悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.25,0:35:30.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.34,0:35:48.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.85,0:35:51.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别挡路
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.60,0:36:12.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.67,0:36:15.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.11,0:36:18.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,界王拳
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.90,0:36:34.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.86,0:36:54.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,儿子杀死老子
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.65,0:36:55.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这才是赛亚人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.14,0:36:57.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡卡罗特
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.06,0:37:01.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你死后我会照顾这小鬼的，你就放心地去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.86,0:37:03.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙，把尾巴切掉
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.78,0:37:09.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,短笛
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.60,0:37:12.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这该死的东西别来碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.20,0:37:39.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭，悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.53,0:38:08.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他当虫子一样碾死
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.37,0:39:17.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么，身上流着最强战士赛亚人之血的你
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.24,0:39:21.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然会跟这种下等生物友好相处
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.27,0:39:28.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭和我都不是赛亚人，我们是地球人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.52,0:39:31.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是如此吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.39,0:39:49.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.50,0:39:56.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样，还说他不是赛亚人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.70,0:40:10.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蠢货，你认为能打赢我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.05,0:40:17.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想把叛徒卡卡罗特的儿子带走
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.20,0:40:21.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我还是一厢情愿太天真了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.26,0:40:25.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.61,0:40:28.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.88,0:40:54.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.99,0:41:00.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸，保护地球
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.60,0:41:03.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.49,0:41:09.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管能否保护地球，我也会保护好你
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.25,0:41:15.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且，我绝对要打败那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.17,0:42:17.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡卡罗特，你是赛亚人的耻辱
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.62,0:42:20.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是卡卡罗特，我叫孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.55,0:42:25.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达列斯大人，这家伙就请交给我们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.61,0:42:34.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些家伙也算挺有本事
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.90,0:42:37.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但终究不是我们的对手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.38,0:42:45.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才好险啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.33,0:42:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们给我滚一边去
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.38,0:42:50.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可不要小看我们
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.22,0:43:09.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,袖手旁观真是好兴致啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.42,0:43:29.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有点本事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.26,0:43:38.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们太碍事了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.54,0:44:01.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡卡罗特，你如果跪下来求我
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.44,0:44:05.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还可以把你和你儿子当伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.96,0:44:08.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过了，我是孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.65,0:44:14.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为能打赢一直在吃神精树果实的我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.80,0:44:20.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你我的力量差距是天差地别的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.92,0:44:23.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不试试怎么知道
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.30,0:45:08.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真庆幸自己还是婴儿时脑袋被撞了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.08,0:45:11.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我没有变成你这样
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.70,0:45:18.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会让你就这么回去的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.46,0:45:20.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战斗力3万
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.42,0:45:33.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事，这家伙的战斗力还在不断上升
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.75,0:46:02.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我赢定了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.04,0:46:31.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凭你那点战斗力根本就不是我的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.45,0:46:35.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就在这即将变成沙漠的星球正中央为你挖个坟墓吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.25,0:46:44.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也算是我作为赛亚人同胞的赠礼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.77,0:46:53.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的力量仅此而已吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.26,0:46:56.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再多陪我玩玩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.60,0:47:02.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,10倍界王拳
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.50,0:47:24.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来，跪下
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.75,0:47:27.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跪下求饶的话我就放你一马
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.70,0:47:30.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我答应过悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.10,0:47:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝不能输
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.10,0:47:35.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样，卡卡罗特
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.66,0:47:38.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.06,0:47:40.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.91,0:48:00.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终究是下级战士，太差了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.13,0:48:02.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我就不一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.39,0:48:07.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠着神精树的果实，我能让全宇宙都拜倒在我脚下
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.26,0:48:19.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空，元气弹
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.00,0:48:24.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用元气弹攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.91,0:48:26.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,短笛
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.03,0:48:28.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,饮茶
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.56,0:48:32.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行，我没力气了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.27,0:48:38.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空，别忘了还有我也在
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.29,0:48:40.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有我
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.56,0:48:42.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小林
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.82,0:48:44.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,饺子
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.05,0:48:47.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也还活着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.37,0:48:50.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.82,0:48:53.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.02,0:48:59.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.92,0:49:11.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还活着啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.76,0:49:17.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了伤疤忘了疼
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.65,0:49:28.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大地，海洋，天空
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.29,0:49:36.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,此时所有活着的世间万物
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.42,0:49:39.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你们的元气分给我
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.02,0:49:43.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了大家，为了地球
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.34,0:49:48.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分给我元气吧，拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.30,0:49:52.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡卡罗特
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.51,0:50:09.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.90,0:50:44.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.46,0:50:53.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.37,0:50:56.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我绝对饶不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.90,0:50:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达列斯，接招
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.01,0:51:28.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球上的元气都被神精树吸收了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.55,0:51:31.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,元气弹的元气不够
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.30,0:51:33.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下完了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.53,0:51:45.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有这些果实在，我就无所畏惧了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.64,0:52:51.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好暖和
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.00,0:52:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.36,0:53:13.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孙
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.89,0:53:20.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空正在从神精树里收集元气
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.69,0:53:49.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好暖和啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.00,0:53:57.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达列斯
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.22,0:54:07.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡卡罗特，你还没死？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.74,0:54:09.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我绝饶不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.45,0:57:26.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快速龙
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.85,0:57:32.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神精树枯萎了，地球或许有救了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.39,0:57:38.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正是因为神精树将其果实所吸收的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.88,0:57:43.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球能量分给了孙悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.43,0:57:45.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才制造出了超级元气弹
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.20,0:57:53.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且，一块块的营养像淋浴一样沐浴着大地
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.44,0:57:59.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给予了世间万物生命的活力
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.17,0:58:39.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真庆幸孙君还是婴儿的时候脑袋被摔了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.09,0:58:41.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.65,0:58:44.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则，他说不定就和达列斯他们结党
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.46,0:58:47.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在宇宙里胡作非为了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.76,0:58:52.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也拜这所赐，我这里还留了个疤
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.20,0:58:56.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，快速龙，听说你也表现不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.94,0:58:59.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也挺厉害的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.76,0:59:06.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙已经和短笛一样，只跟悟饭要好了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.20,0:59:08.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好险啊，好险啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.62,0:59:30.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 看 就在你背后 爱破坏的众神啊 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.67,0:59:32.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我全都看在眼里 清楚无瑕 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.59,0:59:36.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ Dragon! Dragon! (Dragon! Dragon!) ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.26,0:59:38.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 看 就在你身边 爱破坏的众神啊 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.26,0:59:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 手一旦伸出 爆炸一触即发 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.09,0:59:43.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ Dragon! Dragon! (Dragon! Dragon!) ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.26,0:59:50.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 也许你已被盯上 在一片黑暗笼罩下 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.98,0:59:54.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 然而不论任何人 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.11,1:00:00.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 能勇往直前的人就是危险的 比如你 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.61,1:00:06.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 昂然站起来支撑住啊 就算力量不大 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.04,1:00:13.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 让所有人 集结起来为你传达 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.58,1:00:17.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 所有地球万物啊 请你们帮一把 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.42,1:00:21.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 所有地球万物啊 我相信着大家 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.89,1:00:28.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 相信所有的梦想 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.18,1:00:31.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 看 就在你眼前 爱破坏的众神啊 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.23,1:00:32.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我全都感觉得到 了如指掌 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.98,1:00:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ Dragon! Dragon! (Dragon! Dragon!) ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.77,1:00:38.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 看 就在你附近 爱破坏的众神啊 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.78,1:00:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我全都感觉得到 了如指掌 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.61,1:00:44.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ Dragon! Dragon! (Dragon! Dragon!) ∮